10
00:01:01,857 --> 00:01:04,438
[SPEAKER_04]: He feels the sight, but no passion for the sight.

11
00:01:04,899 --> 00:01:10,543
[SPEAKER_04]: There being no passion for the sight... for the sights internally, he understands.

12
00:01:10,783 --> 00:01:13,285
[SPEAKER_04]: There is no passion for sights internally for me.

13
00:01:13,905 --> 00:01:20,370
[SPEAKER_04]: That is how the dhamma is evident, not involving time, verifiable and ushering, to be experienced by the wise for themselves.

14
00:01:21,171 --> 00:01:21,531
